2)\nv48 -> v49: Include additional full-model checkpoints (different seeds) in the inference ensemble to average predictions across seeds and improve robustness/stability. | change: Inserted two full-model checkpoint paths (/model_full_seed138.pth and /model_full_seed747.pth) into the --checkpoints argument so inference will include these extra models in the ensemble; checkpoint paths updated while weights line left unchanged. | score after: 0.80701 (-0.00164)\nv49 -> v50: Replace the previous large-model ensemble with a different (smaller) checkpoint set and adjust ensemble weights/config so inference produces a better submission score. | change: Changed the predict command to use a different config directory and four fold checkpoints (removed two full-seed models), updated ensemble weights, and switched model.path from deberta-v3-large to deberta-v3-small. | score after: 0.81349 (+0.00648)\nv50 -> v51: Use a different experiment/config and DeBERTa backbone (base) and update the checkpoints/weights used by the prediction script to attempt a better/faster inference setup. | change: Changed predict_exp302.py invocation: swapped config from exp301d-small-itpt20-all to exp301-1-base-f0, replaced a 4-fold checkpoints list with a single model_fold0_last.pth, changed model.path from deberta-v3-small to deberta-v3-base, and updated th | score after: 0.81053 (-0.00296)\nv51 -> v52: Switch to DeBERTa-large / new checkpoints and adjust ensemble weights to improve inference predictions. | change: Updated the predict command to use a different config and checkpoint directory (large-itpt10 vs base-f0), swapped model.path from deberta-v3-base to deberta-v3-large, and slightly adjusted the ensemble weights. | score after: 0.81978 (+0.00925)\nv52 -> v53: Adjust the ensemble blend weights for the set of model checkpoints to (hopefully) improve final submission score. | change: Updated the JSON list of ensemble weights passed to the inference script/command — numeric values changed for the five checkpoints. | score after: 0.81104 (-0.00873)\nv53 -> v54: Replace the single-fold checkpoint with a multi-fold ensemble (new config + 4 fold checkpoints) and adjust blend weights to improve prediction robustness and final score. | change: Switched --config from exp301-1-large-itpt10-f0 to exp301-1-large-itpt10-all; replaced a single checkpoint path with four fold checkpoints (model_fold0..3); updated ensemble weights passed to the prediction script. | score after: 0.80482 (-0.00622)\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
